Package: unpakt
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: krotrn <krotrn.ks@gmail.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: libfuse2t64 | libfuse2
Homepage: https://github.com/krotrn/unpakt
Description: Install, update and roll back AppImages and tarballs per user
 unpakt installs AppImages and tarballs into your home directory, adds
 launcher entries and a command on PATH, and can update or roll back each
 app. It comes with a command line tool (unpakt) and a GTK 4 / libadwaita
 interface (unpakt-gui).
 .
 Running AppImages directly needs FUSE 2; without it unpakt extracts them.
